  "changelog": {
    "zh-Hant": "第一版：第10屆立法院委員提案的提案人與連署人超圖，取自 LYAPI（2026 年 11 月 5 日擷取）。670 件由黨團提出、沒有個別委員列名的議案不收錄。43 件上游的提案人與連署人名單都是空白，不收錄。4 個不在第10屆立法委員名單上的姓名（其中 4 個是黨團）未列為超邊成員。1 件議案同一人同時列為提案人與連署人，只保留提案人角色。4 件議案的名單中有重複姓名，各只算一次。1 件議案的提案日期不在第10屆任期內（2013-04-19），照上游資料保留。有 2 個孤立節點。",
    "en": "First version, the sponsor and co-signer hypergraph of member-proposed bills of the 10th Legislative Yuan, from LYAPI (retrieved 2026-11-05, Taipei time). 670 bills filed by a caucus with no individual legislator listed are left out. 43 bills with empty sponsor and co-signer lists upstream are left out. 4 names not on the term-10 legislator roster (4 of them caucuses) are not members of any hyperedge. In 1 bill, one legislator is listed as both sponsor and co-signer; only the sponsor role is kept. In 4 bills, a name repeats within a list; it counts once. 1 bill with a 提案日期 outside the term (2013-04-19) is kept as upstream gives it. Isolated nodes: 2."
  },
